      "constraints": "approved",
      "rationale": "Retain reviewed deferred vLLM lifecycle and readiness constraints. Prepare bounded JSON/CSV data in the consuming worker after runner construction, before init_model. File versions invalidate prepared copies; record identity/checksum, input contracts and live KV memory checks remain. The fused weight/compile action joins both tasks before publishing weights.compile_completed. Only then may compile_already_ready publish ready.compile_model without worker/compiler resources. try_cached_profile retains GPU reservations and may fall back after live validation. All routes retain node inputs/outputs; dispatched routes cannot be changed. ready releases worker-local prepared copies. Named worker affinity and CUDA initialization ordering remain. Cached graph import/binding is serialized across loader threads. Synthetic state/route/resource tests and real serial/scheduled inference validate this single-GPU scope."
    },
